**C1. Delta, scope, hygiene (per branch; FAIL first).** FAIL on branch 1: a path beyond `src/MpsCalc.Api/MpsCalc.Api.csproj`; numstat other than `1 1`; more than one hunk; a hunk header other than `@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@`. FAIL on branch 2: a path beyond the test file; numstat other than `4 5`; hunk headers other than the four listed above; removed lines other than exactly the five listed (by program: the removed lines as a multiset against the closed list; control: a planted removal reads 1); added lines other than exactly four copies of `        Assert.True(report.Refused);`; any existing line moved or reordered (the base file with the five removed lines deleted must equal the head file with the four added lines deleted, byte for byte; control: one changed byte reported). Use BOTH the uncapped local `git diff --name-only`/`--numstat`/`-U0` (in your clone) and `gh api -X GET repos/datasecau/MPS-Commercial-Calculator/compare/main...<branch> --jq '.files[]|[.filename,.additions,.deletions]|@tsv'` (control: a planted extra path is flagged by your classifier). `rev-list --left-right --count main...head` = `0 1` each. Blobs of `ParityProof.cs`, `Directory.Build.props`, `global.json`, `ci.yml` and every other path outside the two equal at main and at each head (recursive `ls-tree` compare, control: a planted changed blob reported). **Hygiene of the ADDED lines and of each commit message (controls: a planted line of each kind counts 1):** non-ASCII bytes 0 (`LC_ALL=C /usr/bin/grep -c '[^ -~]'` on the added lines); trailing whitespace 0; a person-name list of your own (the git author and committer names are the token list, never quoted in STATUS); no decision-card id shape; no `B[0-9][0-9][0-9]` token, no `MPSCALC-[0-9]` key, no finding id, no mutant id as a whole word in an ADDED line or a commit message (a pre-existing `B160` / `B156` / `B98` inside the csproj comment lines is carried unchanged text: a Note at most, quote it and show it byte-equal to main outside the reworded